{"3489340":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ReBlade: The Death Spiral","steam_appid":3489340,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a condemned Synthetic marked for destruction.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons, chips, and augments to forge your own path through endless resets.   <br>Slay mechanical creatures — and rip the truth out of this cyber-mythic city.   <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE RHYTHM OF COMBAT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in ReBlade is built around timing and control. <br>Balance offense and defense, read enemy behavior, and strike at the right moment to seize the advantage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/7347a8e1672a34048bba231ff94af7ac.poster.avif?t=1792487858\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/7347a8e1672a34048bba231ff94af7ac.webm?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/7347a8e1672a34048bba231ff94af7ac.mp4?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR BUILD, BREAK PAST LIMITS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you refine how you fight.<br>Combine weapons, chips, and augments to shape your build, adapt to new challenges, and push further with every cycle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/b7d6393526d436549efb655bcad99ac7.poster.avif?t=1792487858\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/b7d6393526d436549efb655bcad99ac7.webm?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/b7d6393526d436549efb655bcad99ac7.mp4?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENCOUNTER BEASTS, SURVIVE THE TRIALS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient creatures, twisted and reinforced by machinery, stand in your way.<br>Study their patterns, break their defenses, and carve a bloody path to victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/1db1aec565ab682d0a3f124ea64e1a1b.poster.avif?t=1792487858\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/1db1aec565ab682d0a3f124ea64e1a1b.webm?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/1db1aec565ab682d0a3f124ea64e1a1b.mp4?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFY YOUR FATE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound to an endless cycle of destruction, you are forced to repeat, learn, and resist.<br>Meet allies, trade the resources you uncover, and piece together the hidden truth of this world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/46346841463bd76f2f8b6356aebe6ae8.poster.avif?t=1792487858\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/46346841463bd76f2f8b6356aebe6ae8.webm?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/46346841463bd76f2f8b6356aebe6ae8.mp4?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a condemned Synthetic marked for destruction.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons, chips, and augments to forge your own path through endless resets.   <br>Slay mechanical creatures — and rip the truth out of this cyber-mythic city.   <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE RHYTHM OF COMBAT<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in ReBlade is built around timing and control. <br>Balance offense and defense, read enemy behavior, and strike at the right moment to seize the advantage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/7347a8e1672a34048bba231ff94af7ac.poster.avif?t=1792487858\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/7347a8e1672a34048bba231ff94af7ac.webm?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/7347a8e1672a34048bba231ff94af7ac.mp4?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR BUILD, BREAK PAST LIMITS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you refine how you fight.<br>Combine weapons, chips, and augments to shape your build, adapt to new challenges, and push further with every cycle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/b7d6393526d436549efb655bcad99ac7.poster.avif?t=1792487858\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/b7d6393526d436549efb655bcad99ac7.webm?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/b7d6393526d436549efb655bcad99ac7.mp4?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENCOUNTER BEASTS, SURVIVE THE TRIALS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient creatures, twisted and reinforced by machinery, stand in your way.<br>Study their patterns, break their defenses, and carve a bloody path to victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/1db1aec565ab682d0a3f124ea64e1a1b.poster.avif?t=1792487858\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/1db1aec565ab682d0a3f124ea64e1a1b.webm?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/1db1aec565ab682d0a3f124ea64e1a1b.mp4?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFY YOUR FATE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound to an endless cycle of destruction, you are forced to repeat, learn, and resist.<br>Meet allies, trade the resources you uncover, and piece together the hidden truth of this world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/46346841463bd76f2f8b6356aebe6ae8.poster.avif?t=1792487858\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/46346841463bd76f2f8b6356aebe6ae8.webm?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/extras\/46346841463bd76f2f8b6356aebe6ae8.mp4?t=1792487858\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"You are a condemned Synthetic, marked for destruction and trapped in endless resets. In a cyberpunk world inspired by Chinese mythology, harness weapons, chips, and augments to cut through mechanical creatures. Each run brings you closer to breaking the cycle and unravelling the truth.","supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/5bcd6cb43310aaa3b7272be5443d0d69e1436d90\/header.jpg?t=1792487858","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/6ace281dc296f511bb4eb33f589013f2c7147f46\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792487858","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3489340\/6ace281dc296f511bb4eb33f589013f2c7147f46\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792487858","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong>  Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong>  Intel Core i5-9400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16  GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 \/ AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 25 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong>  Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-12400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 8600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 32 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 \/ AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 25 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[]}}}